      "headline": "Highlight Clip: Strategy CEO: Only About 3% of Strategy's Shares Are Tied to MSCI Indexes Strategy CEO: Only About 3% of Strategy's Shares Are Tied to MSCI Indexes On November 13, 2026, Strategy CEO Phong Le told CNBC that only about 3% of Strategy’s shares are tied to MSCI indexes and that he expects any exclusion to have little impact on the company. Le said MSCI had been targeting digital assets for years and, in his view, had concluded that investors should stay away from Bitcoin. He argued that MSCI should remain neutral as an index provider and questioned why it was picking winners and losers in the market. — link",
